<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1200" height="870" viewBox="0 0 1200 870" role="img" aria-labelledby="title desc"><title id="title">mHC 与 Single-Pass mHC：输入混合系数从哪里来</title><desc id="desc">左右两图均从下往上读。左图当前残差预测的 A l 用于当前 Pre Mapping；右图使用上一子层的 A l减1，当前预测的 A l 沿蓝色虚线交给下一子层。B l 与 C l 均由当前残差预测，供当前 Res 与 Post Mapping 使用。</desc><defs><marker id="arrow" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6.2" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L7 3.5L0 7Z" fill="#343434"/></marker><marker id="coef" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6.2" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L7 3.5L0 7Z" fill="#2c75a4"/></marker></defs><style>text{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC',sans-serif;fill:#262626}.wire{fill:none;stroke:#343434;stroke-width:1.8;marker-end:url(#arrow)}.coef{fill:none;stroke:#2c75a4;stroke-width:2;stroke-dasharray:6 4;marker-end:url(#coef)}</style>
<g transform="translate(0 0)">
<text x="300" y="33" text-anchor="middle" font-size="27" font-weight="650" style="fill:#262626">mHC</text>
<text x="300" y="63" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" font-weight="400" style="fill:#5b6d67">等待当前子层预测输入混合系数</text>
<rect x="18" y="85" width="564" height="565" rx="18" fill="#f2f2f2" stroke="none"/>
<text x="40" y="114" text-anchor="start" font-size="16" font-weight="650" style="fill:#262626">当前子层 · 局部展开</text>
<rect x="115" y="134" width="68" height="28" rx="3" fill="#e5e5e5" stroke="#aaa"/>
<rect x="112" y="137" width="68" height="28" rx="3" fill="#e5e5e5" stroke="#aaa"/>
<rect x="109" y="140" width="68" height="28" rx="3" fill="#e5e5e5" stroke="#aaa"/>
<rect x="106" y="143" width="68" height="28" rx="3" fill="#e5e5e5" stroke="#aaa"/>
<g data-tex="X_{l+1}" data-label="" data-x="140" data-y="164" data-size="21" data-anchor="middle" data-color="#252525"/>
<circle cx="140" cy="224" r="14" fill="white" stroke="#343434" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<g data-tex="+" data-label="" data-x="140" data-y="231" data-size="24" data-anchor="middle" data-color="#252525"/>
<path class="wire" d="M140 210V171"/>
<rect x="115" y="343" width="68" height="28" rx="3" fill="#e5e5e5" stroke="#aaa"/>
<rect x="112" y="346" width="68" height="28" rx="3" fill="#e5e5e5" stroke="#aaa"/>
<rect x="109" y="349" width="68" height="28" rx="3" fill="#e5e5e5" stroke="#aaa"/>
<rect x="106" y="352" width="68" height="28" rx="3" fill="#e5e5e5" stroke="#aaa"/>
<g data-tex="B_lX_l" data-label="" data-x="140" data-y="373" data-size="21" data-anchor="middle" data-color="#252525"/>
<rect x="61" y="421" width="158" height="64" rx="5" fill="#fff0e3" stroke="#c78953"/>
<text x="140" y="444" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" font-weight="400" style="fill:#262626">Res Mapping</text>
<g data-tex="B_l" data-label="" data-x="140" data-y="472" data-size="23" data-anchor="middle" data-color="#252525"/>
<path class="wire" d="M140 590V485"/>
<path class="wire" d="M140 421V380"/>
<path class="wire" d="M140 343V238"/>
<text x="210" y="402" text-anchor="middle" font-size="16" font-weight="400" style="fill:#5b6d67">混合旧残差</text>
<rect x="271" y="515" width="158" height="64" rx="5" fill="#fff0e3" stroke="#c78953"/>
<text x="350" y="538" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" font-weight="400" style="fill:#262626">Pre Mapping</text>
<g data-tex="A_l" data-label="" data-x="350" data-y="566" data-size="23" data-anchor="middle" data-color="#252525"/>
<rect x="316" y="464" width="68" height="28" rx="3" fill="#e5e5e5" stroke="#aaa"/>
<g data-tex="h_l^{\mathrm{in}}" data-label="" data-x="350" data-y="485" data-size="21" data-anchor="middle" data-color="#252525"/>
<rect x="271" y="387" width="158" height="44" rx="5" fill="#cfe6f1" stroke="#535b60"/>
<text x="305" y="415" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" font-weight="400" style="fill:#262626">Layer</text>
